      "a": "(a) $Q=2 L^{2} K^{2} \\ldots . .(1)$\n\n$L=5$ units of labour\n\n$\\mathrm{K}=2$ units of capital\n\nPutting these values in equation (1)\n\n$\\mathrm{Q}=2(5)^{2}(2)^{2}$\n\n$=2(25)(4)$\n\n$\\mathrm{Q}=200 \\text { units }$\n\n(b) If $\\mathrm{L}=0$ units and $\\mathrm{K}=100$ units\n\nPutting these values in equation (1)\n\n$\\mathrm{Q}=2(0)^{2}(100)^{2}$\n\n$\\mathrm{Q}=0 \\text { units }$"
