      "q": "20. The following table shows the total revenue and total cost schedules of a competitive firm. Calculate the profit at each output level. Determine also the market price of the good.\n\nQuantity Sold\n\nTR\n\nTC\n\nProfit\n\n0\n\n0\n\n5\n\n1\n\n5\n\n7\n\n2\n\n10\n\n10\n\n3\n\n15\n\n12\n\n4\n\n20\n\n15\n\n5\n\n25\n\n23\n\n6\n\n30\n\n33\n\n7\n\n35\n\n40",
      "a": "Quantity sold\n\nTR\n\nTC\n\nProfit\n\nAR = TR / Q\n\n0\n\n0\n\n5\n\n0 \u2013 5 = - 5\n\n-\n\n1\n\n5\n\n7\n\n5 \u2013 7 = -2\n\n5/1 = 5\n\n2\n\n10\n\n10\n\n10 \u2013 10 = 0\n\n10/2 = 5\n\n3\n\n15\n\n12\n\n15 \u2013 12 = 3\n\n15/3 = 5\n\n4\n\n20\n\n15\n\n20 \u2013 15 = 5\n\n20/4 = 5\n\n5\n\n25\n\n23\n\n25 \u2013 23 = 2\n\n25/5 = 5\n\n6\n\n30\n\n33\n\n30 \u2013 33 = -3\n\n30/6 = 5\n\n7\n\n35\n\n40\n\n35 \u2013 40 = -5\n\n35/7 = 5"
